cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use K-Dense BYOK in your research, please cite the paper below."
title: "K-Dense BYOK"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A free, open-source AI research assistant for scientists in any field that
  runs on the researcher's own computer with the model credentials they choose,
  and keeps a hash-chained Living Lab Notebook and an observed provenance log.
